{"title": "Infernal Iron", "pageid": 8101, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Infernal_Iron", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png/300px-Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/d/d4/Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Iron image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png/300px-Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Infernal_Alloy_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Infernal Iron</b> is a metal superficially similar to iron produced in the Nine Hells. It is used to manufacture all kinds of infernal-touched items, such as the <a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_set\" title=\"Helldusk set\">Helldusk set</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This dented piece of black metal has a red shine to it, no matter the lighting. Faint screams echo through your mind whenever you touch it.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 100 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  100  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-386948b24e910ebbEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7bd29d7981f24783END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e7a728191bfe10daEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_Ketheric_Infernal_Plate_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Ketheric_Infernal_Plate_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Ketheric_Infernal_Plate_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6242490e-42c9-49f0-bc3b-4e7ec11c0fe7</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6242490e-42c9-49f0-bc3b-4e7ec11c0fe7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6242490e-42c9-49f0-bc3b-4e7ec11c0fe7\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBJ_InfernalPlate</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_InfernalPlate+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_InfernalPlate+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_1\">Act 1</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Inside a chest in the forge basement in the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-434&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-370</span></li>\n<li>Inside <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dror_Ragzlin\" title=\"Dror Ragzlin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Dror_Ragzlin.png/25px-Portrait_Dror_Ragzlin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Dror_Ragzlin.png/38px-Portrait_Dror_Ragzlin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Dror_Ragzlin.png/50px-Portrait_Dror_Ragzlin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dror Ragzlin's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Dror_Ragzlin.png/25px-Portrait_Dror_Ragzlin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Portrait_Dror_Ragzlin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dror_Ragzlin\" title=\"Dror Ragzlin\">Dror Ragzlin's</a> Treasure Crates in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;298&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;66</span></li>\n<li>Inside a trapped chest, in a locked room in the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Basement\" title=\"Zhentarim Basement\">Zhentarim Basement</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;285&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-165</span></li>\n<li>Sold or given as reward by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kith\" title=\"Kith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png/25px-Portrait_Kith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png/38px-Portrait_Kith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png/50px-Portrait_Kith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stonemason Kith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png/25px-Portrait_Kith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Portrait_Kith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kith\" title=\"Kith\">Stonemason Kith</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-662&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;375</span>, labelled as <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Alloy\" title=\"Infernal Alloy\">Infernal Alloy</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_2\">Act 2</span></h4>\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Mason%27s_Guild\" title=\"Mason's Guild\">Reithwin Mason's Guild</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-105&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;18</span></li>\n<li>Inside an Opulent Chest in the vault room near <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/25px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/38px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/50px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Balthazar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/25px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-821&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-752</span></li>\n<li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yurgir\" title=\"Yurgir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/25px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/38px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/50px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yurgir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/25px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yurgir\" title=\"Yurgir\">Yurgir</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-647&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-758</span>, labelled as <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Metal\" title=\"Infernal Metal\">Infernal Metal</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_3\">Act 3</span></h4>\n<ul><li>On the floor in <a href=\"/wiki/Flymm_Cargo\" title=\"Flymm Cargo\">Flymm Cargo's Basement</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1078&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;312</span></li>\n<li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png/25px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png/38px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png/50px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Steel Watchers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png/25px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watchers</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></li>\n<li>On a table in the submersible dock room at the start of the <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Throne\" title=\"Iron Throne\">Iron Throne</a></li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Huido\" title=\"Huido\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/25px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/38px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/50px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Huido\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/25px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Huido\" title=\"Huido\">Huido</a> at the docks for 1,000 gp after passing a successful dialogue check (certain classes can avoid paying)</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Item_crafting\">Item crafting</span></h4>\n<p>If given a piece of infernal alloy at the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/25px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/38px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/50px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dammon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/25px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\">Dammon</a> forges (in order):\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Armour\">Flawed Helldusk Armour</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Helmet\">Flawed Helldusk Helmet</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Gloves\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Gloves\">Flawed Helldusk Gloves</a></span></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests\">Quests</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Infernal Iron is needed for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach's</a> companion quest, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hellion%27s_Heart\" title=\"The Hellion's Heart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Hellion's Heart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Hellion%27s_Heart\" title=\"The Hellion's Heart\">The Hellion's Heart</a>.\n<ul><li>Giving Dammon a piece of <b>Infernal Iron</b> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid_Grove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druid Grove\">Druid Grove</a> allows him to upgrade Karlach's infernal engine, granting her the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Iron\" title=\"Heart of Iron\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Heart_of_Iron_Icon.webp/20px-Heart_of_Iron_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Heart_of_Iron_Icon.webp/30px-Heart_of_Iron_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Heart_of_Iron_Icon.webp/40px-Heart_of_Iron_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heart of Iron\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Heart_of_Iron_Icon.webp/20px-Heart_of_Iron_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Heart_of_Iron_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Iron\" title=\"Heart of Iron\">Heart of Iron</a> passive feature.</li>\n<li>Later, when the party meet Dammon again at the Last Light Inn blacksmith, he can be given another piece of <b>Infernal Iron</b> to further upgrade Karlach's infernal engine, replacing her previous bonus with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heart_Ablaze\" title=\"Heart Ablaze\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Heart_Ablaze_Icon.webp/20px-Heart_Ablaze_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Heart_Ablaze_Icon.webp/30px-Heart_Ablaze_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Heart_Ablaze_Icon.webp/40px-Heart_Ablaze_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heart Ablaze\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Heart_Ablaze_Icon.webp/20px-Heart_Ablaze_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Heart_Ablaze_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_Ablaze\" title=\"Heart Ablaze\">Heart Ablaze</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Alloy\" title=\"Infernal Alloy\">Infernal Alloy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Metal\" title=\"Infernal Metal\">Infernal Metal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enriched_Infernal_Iron\" title=\"Enriched Infernal Iron\">Enriched Infernal Iron</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_appearances\">Alternate appearances</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 252px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Infernal_Iron_C_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Infernal Iron appearance when looted from certain Steel Watchers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Infernal_Iron_C_Icon.png/375px-Infernal_Iron_C_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/5/52/Infernal_Iron_C_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Iron\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Infernal_Iron_C_Icon.png/375px-Infernal_Iron_C_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Infernal_Iron_C_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Infernal Iron appearance when looted from certain <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watchers</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Infernal_iron\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal iron\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon